Given the heterogeneous residual variances in the multi-trial analyses, we estimated the proportion of total genetic variance captured by all QTL in the final set. QTL effects were treated as fixed, and the proportion was calculated based on the reduction in genetic variance (\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
